{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "335fc77fef92b4bc0acea2bcae8bc8ecbde892d1eeef96e00766d5e9be7afc2c", "ja": "（次のアポイントまで、少し時間が空いてしまった。\n近場で時間を潰すか……ん？）", "zh": "（到下一个预定前，空了一点时间出来呢。\n在附近打发一下时间吧……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4fa680960010d549ba0affc150d1a72a1f58c8aa8fe6e651bcd4a441244f026d", "ja": "指先まで、腕の伸びを意識して……ここで、ターン。\nうんっ、今のはうまくできた……♪", "zh": "直到指尖为止，都要意识到手臂的伸展……\n然后在这里转圈。嗯，这次很顺利……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "22a92473c1282e611a6bfae1827f8b6e5f7a7c914628228764ede2c8db46ae44", "ja": "あれは……紬じゃないか。\nおーい、紬！", "zh": "那个人……不是䌷吗？\n喂～䌷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55773578e7fce9d7a2f952b4f845784c61f3ecb16f3aeb7618c5de8c44775969", "ja": "っ！　{$P$}？\nど、どうして、こちらに？", "zh": "呜！{$P$}？\n你、你为什么，会来这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8541c7f20d61102d12d0fbf8dfd11b31b78b15c41c2a820676ff57ac8c206c24", "ja": "営業の途中で、ちょっとひと休みにな。\n紬はダンスの自主練か？", "zh": "我是在谈生意途中，稍微来休息一下的。\n䌷在自主练习舞步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "42acf9078d296869bb4ee0ff055734e99d6a0408552e4ccb1a7df92ce968f5a7", "ja": "ええ、まあ。そちらは随分と気の抜けたご様子ですね。\nプロデュースを任せていていいのか、心配になります。", "zh": "嗯，算是吧。你看起来倒是一派轻松呢，\n我都开始担心该不该让你培育我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7c8e6e84c100b73932702632be2b0b5eb4a3879a2e5ee694d08606f416bb5756", "ja": "はは、ちゃんとやってるから安心してくれ。\nそれにしても、紬のダンスはかなり上達したな！", "zh": "哈哈，我有在好好做事，所以你放心吧。\n不过话又说回来，䌷的舞蹈进步了很多呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "285d9878ebd2a25da2c83a292ef4f1a508c2998baaa82eb4232a659fca7723e1", "ja": "つまり、歌は一向に上達しないと？", "zh": "意思是我唱歌完全没进步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "90dd3fca4032f060f9b45d6390e25910afc17761e6b837c2d736fe3601b8a10c", "ja": "ち、違う違う。\n今のダンスを見て、純粋に感心しただけだよ。", "zh": "不、不是不是。\n我是看了你刚才的舞蹈，单纯觉得佩服罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b7985867c878e52f33a89b8d33488968b618368c11a115ee34f64e9e1cd3994", "ja": "そうですか。それならいいのですが。\nあなたの言動は、どうも紛らわしくて困ります。", "zh": "是吗，那就好。\n你的言行举止很容易让人搞混，让我很困扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "200cf3a5ee6b2b2457bb0eb60255a6fd5dfffeec84d7124d628e0620d8d8e187", "ja": "そう、か……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e84f9f55bb59f37767ddf34abfc2aac7803fd181447f659320827dbba51343fd", "ja": "自覚がないとは呆れます。もっと気を付けてください。\nあなたは私のプロデューサーなのですから。", "zh": "居然一点自觉都没有，简直太令人无言以对了。\n请你多注意点，因为你可是我的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "978aaacce6cc673eb43c1a2a307ef5ff60142c2a9cb84dea22a9753c7da02f70", "ja": "ふむ……確かに、意志の疎通は大事だよな。", "zh": "嗯……的确，互相沟通想法是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d32f5e2ea3dc15e8cd4eebb986cd8b9aa4aca902b4d6c68578997be5dbcc8df3", "ja": "俺はプロデューサーで、紬は俺のアイドルだ。\n心をひとつに頑張っていこう！", "zh": "我是制作人，而䌷是我的偶像。\n所以让我们同心协力，一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c054716b05b972ef10ae9db45baa062cf551b1d35a295ea08f40dc1dc029acca", "ja": "っ！　言ったそばから……あなたはやはり、\nバカなのですか？　……もう、知りません！", "zh": "呜！才刚说完你就……你果然是笨蛋吧？\n……真是的，我不理你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b41e411e6d5cc8b2903369ed223d417d5399cd8772779ad33de967e8072935d8", "ja": "（顔を赤らめて立ち去ってしまった……。紬との\n言葉のキャッチボールは、一向に上達しないな……）", "zh": "（她满脸通红地走掉了……\n我和䌷的对话，老是无法顺利进展呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
